content.reasoning:
I can't read the response directly by its ID. Let me think about what I know.

The position response showed:
```json
{
  "vehicles": [
    {"vehicle_id": "veh-3f12", "route_id": "rt-9f3a", "lat": 44.9821, "lon": -93.2774, "status": "in_service"},
    {"vehicle_id": "veh-7a90", "route_id": "rt-2201", "lat": 44.951, "lon": -93.09, "status": "in_service"}
  ]
}
```

Only position data, no telemetry inline.


The telemetry endpoint only returns data for veh-3f12, but not for veh-7a90. Let me try filtering the route parameter to see if that gives me the right vehicle's telemetry data.

